# U39: the SkillSelect section's selectors (CalcsTab.lua:45-148): the Calculation Mode dropdown
# (misc_buffMode = "UNBUFFED", AddUndoState, buildFlag: a recalc through the bridge), Ctrl+Z /
# Ctrl+Y (UndoHandler over `calcsTab.input`, CalcsTab.lua:323-328), then the Socket Group
# dropdown (skill_number = 5: Leap Slam; the section's update function refreshes the selectors
# with RefreshSkillSelectControls(…, "Calcs")) and its hover tooltip (the U30 stand-in). Each
# step is snapshotted (T4: the Calcs section's Input values).
#! u39-expect-calcs misc_buffMode" string="UNBUFFED"
#! u39-expect-calcs name="skill_number" number="5"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 4
key-up CTRL
frames 3
# Calculation Mode: open, pick "Unbuffed"
move 500 128
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 500 145
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot unbuffed
# undo, redo
move 1270 790
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undone
key-down CTRL
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot redone
# Socket Group: hover (tooltip), open, pick the 5th group
move 600 92
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 520 157
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1270 790
frames 2
snapshot group5
